3. Astronomy data
-----------------

Directories and files:
  public/data/stars/                 minimum star survey (HiPS, eph tiles)
  public/data/dsos/                  base deep sky object survey (HiPS, eph tiles)
  public/data/skycultures/western/   western sky culture (index.json, illustrations)
  public/data/landscapes/guereins/   Guereins landscape (HiPS, webp tiles)
  public/data/meteor-showers.json    meteor shower model data

Source: Stellarium Web project content distribution
URL: https://stellarium.sfo2.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/stellarium-web/libswe-1.17.0

These files are a mirror of content distributed by the Stellarium project.
Each dataset may carry its own license and attribution terms, set by the
