Stellarium project and its upstream data providers are the source of truth
for the licensing of these datasets.


4. Catalogue data on the planisphere and Plates page
----------------------------------------------------

The star positions, visual magnitudes and spectral types shown on the
planisphere and on the Plates page follow the Yale Bright Star Catalog as
catalogued in VizieR V/50, quoted from the corresponding SIMBAD records.
Coordinates for the deep sky objects follow SIMBAD, with galaxy distances
from NASA/IPAC NED.

VizieR V/50:
  https://vizier.cds.unistra.fr/viz-bin/VizieR?-source=V/50
SIMBAD:
  https://simbad.u-strasbg.fr/simbad/
NASA/IPAC NED:
  https://ned.ipac.caltech.edu/


